# Multi-Layer Boundaries And Contracts

- Keep layers separate: runtime, orchestration, routing, tools, policies, observability.
- Runtime/provider specifics must stay behind adapter interfaces.
- Tool execution must use typed input/output contracts.
- Do not let controllers own orchestration logic.
- Prevent cross-layer shortcuts that bypass policy middleware.
